20:07.100 --> 20:09.990
Ah, right! Well done, sir!

20:10.240 --> 20:12.280
Let's get going, Mahoro-chan.

20:14.570 --> 20:16.040
Arajin-kun.

20:17.450 --> 20:18.580
Oh... huh?

20:18.580 --> 20:21.040
Will you fight for me?

20:21.340 --> 20:22.990
Ho— Wow!

20:25.440 --> 20:27.460
You've got some nerve

20:28.140 --> 20:31.420
putting your hands on my little sister.

20:31.830 --> 20:34.050
Little sister?!

20:35.860 --> 20:38.670
What's up, bringing me way out here?

20:38.670 --> 20:39.860
Check it out.

20:43.970 --> 20:45.060
Ara-chan?!

20:45.350 --> 20:47.960
Think he'll make it out alive?

20:54.660 --> 20:56.190
Ah... wait!

21:02.240 --> 21:03.780
Get your ass up!

21:05.160 --> 21:07.790
I'm dead. He's literally going to kill me.

21:08.410 --> 21:10.090
Get up, punk!

21:10.090 --> 21:12.630
Get up and let's see you make Mahoro happy!

21:12.630 --> 21:17.380
My brother is losing it all
because of me? He's so cool!

21:17.730 --> 21:20.260
That's the 35th victim.

21:20.260 --> 21:21.760
Poor guy.

21:22.180 --> 21:24.970
No good this time either, huh.

21:24.970 --> 21:27.520
Even if I merged with this kid,

21:28.240 --> 21:31.020
I would never be able to meet... that one.

21:35.740 --> 21:38.640
You really think I'm gonna... die now?

21:40.630 --> 21:43.240
Right... here?

21:43.590 --> 21:46.160
Like... this?

21:48.930 --> 21:52.790
Now say it! What do you truly wish for?

21:54.690 --> 21:56.380
My one...

21:59.140 --> 22:00.810
wish is...

22:03.100 --> 22:08.560
to lose my virginity!

22:08.560 --> 22:11.730
Bucchigiri!

22:12.710 --> 22:13.730
Whoa!

22:23.780 --> 22:23.990
Honki

